  "notes": "final-round wave-3 2026-10-14: pid 2411140513211626400 (CJJT2194663), listedNum 3. Listing: 'Nordic Black And White Abstract Decorative Painting Wabi-sabi Style Hanging Painting'; 12 prints A-L (A Parallel, B Thorns, C Nightfall, D Support, E Twine, F Ping Hit, G Withstand, H Flow elimination, I Rely on, J Touch, K Connect, L Isolation), all black ink gestures on cream, same frame and mat. Verbatim: 'Outer frame material: Aluminum alloy'; 'Conventional: aluminum alloy + canvas'; 'Containing glass: aluminum alloy + precision-cut cardboard + high-transparency organic glass'; sizes 40x40 and 50x50. Photos: thin matte-black frame, very wide warm-white mat (image window about 45% of the width), so charcoal covers roughly 10-15% of the face. COPY RISK (designer/QA must check before listing): the brushwork reads like Franz Kline's black ink studies (1950s, still in copyright); no artist is named and the titles are generic, but if these are reproductions of known works they are banned (studio rule: no known works). Plexiglass is 'high-transparency', not anti-reflective. ROOM SKU: vid 2411140513211627100 ('Style A-Contains glass-50x50cm', CJJT219466304DW, $14.59 each, 3.12 kg packed, carton 55x55x5); sold as a PAIR (diptych) by default, single piece also on the product page. price.cost = 2 x $14.59. FREIGHT to IL per piece (glass 50x50): CJPacket Eub 12-50 d $43.07; Sensitive 22-27 d $65.65; To Door 11-18 d $70.28; DHL 3-7 d $233.52. Conventional 50x50 (vid 2411140513211626800, $12.93): Eub $42.19. ECONOMICS (Studio formula, pair, Eub): ship $82.42, landed ILS 368.28; at ILS 649 contribution ILS 123.54, margin 22.5% (below 40%, no loss; breakeven ILS 487). Conventional pair: landed ILS 351.52, 25.5% at ILS 649. Fast option (To Door 11-18 d) loses at ILS 649 (-10.2%). At the old slot price ILS 379 the pair loses (-25.4%), hence the Israeli-value price. Single 50x50 glazed at ILS 349: 24.9%. PRICE BASIS (Israeli comps, per framed 50x50-class print): Tollmans Paper Collective OVATA LINEWORK 50x50 + frame ILS 389 (https://www.tollmansdot.co.il/product/ovata_linework_light_02_50x50/); Elior Decor framed paper print, black aluminium frame ILS 400 (https://www.eliordecor.co.il/product/תמונה-לסלון-soft-cotton-beige-הדפס-נייר-ממוסגר-בפורמ/); Print Studio minimalist abstract from ILS 399 (https://printstudio.co.il/product/%d7%aa%d7%9e%d7%95%d7%a0%d7%94-%d7%9e%d7%95%d7%a4%d7%a9%d7%98%d7%aa-%d7%a2%d7%99%d7%92%d7%95%d7%9c%d7%99%d7%9d-%d7%9e%d7%99%d7%a0%d7%99%d7%9e%d7%9c%d7%99%d7%a1%d7%98%d7%99%d7%9d/); mass-market floor: Fox Home Leaf 60x60 dark frame ILS 149.93 (https://www.foxhome.co.il/products/0332680300). Typical designer pair ~ILS 790 -> ILS 649 (-18%). ENVELOPE (master framed-art, Nordic: diptych of two squares 50x50-55x55, gap 8-10, total 110-120 x 50-60): 2 x 50 + gap 10 = 110 x 50 -> fits. Spec match: charcoal element in every print, matte-black frame, warm-white mat, glazing; content soft abstract. STYLE FIT GUESS (sourcing, not a designer score): nordic 7.5 (all 12 prints fit; designer picks 3), warm-modern 6, japandi 6.5, mediterranean 3, modern-country 3, boho 3."
